    "text": "<p>Consider the following reactions<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>4</mn></math><br />The order of the above reactions are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>and</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>,</mo></math>respectively. The following graph is obtained when log[rate] vs.log[conc.] are plotted:</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/18edb2b0-209a-4c3f-b365-1153e3f38f8e-image.png\" style=\"width: 244px; height: 212px;\" />&nbsp;&nbsp;<br />Among the following, the correct sequence for the order of the reactions is :</p>",
